{"tuid":"wsjmvbv5tsyrsp9g","pageVersion":17,"fetchedAt":"2026-09-30T09:55:56.751Z","record":{"colophon":{"generator":"ifdb.org/viewgame","generatorversion":1,"originated":"2025-02-19"},"identification":{"ifids":["0D6BE216-D4AD-46F4-BD39-D48383DE26CD"],"format":"glulx"},"bibliographic":{"title":"Ether","author":"MathBrush","language":"en","firstpublished":"2015-10-01","genre":"Fantasy/Surreal","description":"&quot;For the first time in centuries, something is different. Your tentacles tingle as you float to the east past icebergs and whirlwinds. You skirt a pocket of hot air, bounce through a field of ice, and finally come upon a massive stormcloud filling the sky to the east.&quot; <br> <br>A game about a flying cephalopod and its airy world. This short adventure recreates the feel of exploring a world in a graphical game, and uses a 9x9x9 cubical grid. Navigate the world in 26 directions as you collect items and use the properties of your environment to unlock their power. An in-game walkthrough is included, as are instructions for those new to parser interactive fiction, where you type in commands."},"contacts":[],"ifdb":{"tuid":"wsjmvbv5tsyrsp9g","pageversion":17,"link":"https://ifdb.org/viewgame?id=wsjmvbv5tsyrsp9g","coverart":{"url":"https://ifdb.org/coverart?id=wsjmvbv5tsyrsp9g&version=17"},"primaryPlayOnlineUrl":"https://iplayif.com/?story=https%3A%2F%2Fifarchive.org%2Fif-archive%2Fgames%2Fcompetition2015%2FEther%2FEther.gblorb","downloads":{"links":[{"url":"https://ifarchive.org/if-archive/games/competition2015/Ether/Ether.gblorb","playOnlineUrl":"https://iplayif.com/?story=https%3A%2F%2Fifarchive.org%2Fif-archive%2Fgames%2Fcompetition2015%2FEther%2FEther.gblorb","title":"Story File","desc":"IFComp 2015 release","isGame":true,"format":"blorb/glulx"},{"url":"http://allthingsjacq.com/intfic_clubfloyd_20160104.html","title":"ClubFloyd Transcript","format":"html"},{"url":"https://www.ifarchive.org/if-archive/games/source/inform/EtherSource.txt","title":"Source T